    {
      "id": "rec-analytics-renewal:seg:0",
      "text": "The analytics contract renews on November 30th. Do we keep them?"
    },
    {
      "id": "rec-analytics-renewal:seg:1",
      "text": "Usage is down. Only the growth team still logs in every week."
    },
    {
      "id": "rec-analytics-renewal:seg:2",
      "text": "Then let's renegotiate instead of renewing as is. can you get a quote for ten seats instead of twenty five?"
    },
    {
      "id": "rec-analytics-renewal:seg:3",
      "text": "Sure I will ask their account manager for the ten seat price by Thursday."
    },
    {
      "id": "rec-analytics-renewal:seg:4",
      "text": "If it's under eight thousand thousand a year we sign it if not we look at alternatives."
    },
    {
      "id": "rec-analytics-renewal:seg:5",
      "text": "Under eight thousand got it I should I give them notice that we might not renew?"
    },
    {
      "id": "rec-analytics-renewal:seg:6",
      "text": "Yes the contract contract needs thirty days notice so send it before October thirty first"
    },
    {
      "id": "rec-analytics-renewal:seg:7",
      "text": "I will send the notice tomorrow and copy you"
    },
    {
      "id": "rec-analytics-renewal:seg:8",
      "text": "Thanks and export last year dashboards in case we switch."
    },
    {
      "id": "rec-analytics-renewal:seg:9",
      "text": "Will do. I will put the exports in the shared drive."
    }
  ],
